---@field clientCertificate? string Optional. A reference to a certificatemanager.googleapis.com.Certificate resource. This is a relative resource path following the form "projects/{project}/locations/{location}/certificates/{certificate}". Used by a BackendService to negotiate mTLS when the backend connection uses TLS and the backend requests a client certificate. Must have a CLIENT_AUTH scope.
---@field name? string Required. Name of the BackendAuthenticationConfig resource. It matches the pattern `projects/*/locations/{location}/backendAuthenticationConfigs/{backend_authentication_config}`
---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when the resource was created.
