---@field sources? gcp.unstable.networksecurity_v1beta1.SourceList Optional. List of attributes for the traffic source. All of the sources must match. A source is a match if both principals and ip_blocks match. If not set, the action specified in the 'action' field will be applied without any rule checks for the source.
---@field destinations? gcp.unstable.networksecurity_v1beta1.DestinationList Optional. List of attributes for the traffic destination. All of the destinations must match. A destination is a match if a request matches all the specified hosts, ports, methods and headers. If not set, the action specified in the 'action' field will be applied without any rule checks for the destination.

---@alias gcp.unstable.networksecurity_v1beta1.RuleList gcp.unstable.networksecurity_v1beta1.Rule[]

