---Specification of traffic source attributes.
---@class gcp.unstable.networksecurity_v1beta1.Source
---@field ipBlocks? gcp.unstable.networksecurity_v1beta1.StringList Optional. List of CIDR ranges to match based on source IP address. At least one IP block should match. Single IP (e.g., "1.2.3.4") and CIDR (e.g., "1.2.3.0/24") are supported. Authorization based on source IP alone should be avoided. The IP addresses of any load balancers or proxies should be considered untrusted.
